&lt;p&gt;Cascade Natural Gas General Rate Case: Docket #&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://apps.puc.state.or.us/edockets/DocketNoLayout.asp?DocketID=24815"&gt;UG 525&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

