&lt;strong&gt;Josiah Gaither, St. Stephen&rsquo;s Academy (Beaverton);&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Kaydence Pope, South Medford High School (Medford);&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Molly Wheeler, South Medford High School (Medford);&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Rain Obiesie, Lakeridge High School (Lake Oswego);&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
