&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oregon Community Foundation&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
